      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L110-112",
      "text": "The `pulumi import` command takes the form `pulumi import <type-token> <name> <id>`, e.g. `pulumi import aws:ec2/vpc:Vpc main-vpc vpc-12345`.",
